  "details": "# Suggestion\nWith the new avatar section you can sort by recently used, title and last updated. I feel like it will be very useful having a sort by performance as in many situations in Vrchat you may need to use more optimised model. \n# Potential Implementation\nThis could be implemented in one of two ways:\n-It sorts from excellent to very poor (Top to Bottom)\nOR\n-It is split up into sections such as Excellent, good, medium, poor and very poor.\nIf the first option is chosen it would be nice seeing the performance logo on the avatar preview rather than clicking on it.\n# Conclusion\nThis hopefully will remove that moment where you have to say \"let me quickly find a optimal Avatar\" and then clicking on every avatar to find the good preforming one. Overall this benefits everyone especially people who go to a large amount of events in Vrchat.",
